      "note": "NIH RePORTER (wired 2026-09-19 via openclaw-bridge/mcp/nih-reporter/). NIH publishes RePORTER data as public-domain US Government information. NOTE ON MATCHING: license-review.js normalizeDomain() returns the FULL hostname and looks it up as an EXACT key -- there is no subdomain matching in THIS file (unlike gate.config.js primary_source_domains, where subdomains do match). So the host a record actually carries must appear here verbatim, which is why api.reporter.nih.gov is listed separately."
